1
00:00:08,170 --> 00:00:10,800
Monica,that was the best Thanksgiving dinner ever.
這真是史上最棒的感恩節大餐 

2
00:00:11,010 --> 00:00:13,570
It was so good. I think you killed us.
太好吃了 你把我們撐死了

4
00:00:15,380 --> 00:00:17,640
I couldn't possibly eat another bite.
我連一口都吃不下了

5
00:00:18,010 --> 00:00:20,040
I need something sweet.
我要吃甜的

6
00:00:21,520 --> 00:00:23,070
Does anyone want to watch TV?
有人想看電視嗎？ 好啊

7
00:00:27,090 --> 00:00:29,150
Monica,your remote doesn't work.
摩妮卡，你的遙控器按不動

8
00:00:29,390 --> 00:00:31,920
You have to lift it and point.
你得把它拿起來對準

9
00:00:35,060 --> 00:00:36,500
Oh,forget it.
算了

10
00:00:38,400 --> 00:00:43,030
Let's play that game where everyone says one thing they're thankful for.
你們知道嗎？ 我們應該來玩感恩告白遊戲

11
00:00:44,210 --> 00:00:48,010
I am thankful for this beautiful fall we've been having.
我要說 感謝今年的秋天這麼美

12
00:00:48,240 --> 00:00:49,770
Very nice.
說得真好

13
00:00:50,250 --> 00:00:52,210
The other day, I was at the bus stop...
那天我在等公車

14
00:00:52,410 --> 00:00:56,940
...and this lovely fall breeze came and blew this chick's skirt up.
突然吹來一陣秋風 把一個女生的裙子吹了起來

15
00:00:58,890 --> 00:01:02,790
Which reminds me, I'm also thankful for thongs.
對了，我還要感謝丁字褲

16
00:01:04,860 --> 00:01:06,620
The One with the Thanksgiving Flashbacks
本集播出：「感恩大回顧」

00:01:07,860 --> 00:01:08,620
rainystar壓制iPod-MP4

17
00:01:52,510 --> 00:01:55,700
It's not so much an underpant as a feat of engineering.
與其說它是內褲 不如說是一種偉大工程

18
00:01:57,350 --> 00:01:58,370
It's amazing...
效果那麼驚人

19
00:01:58,580 --> 00:02:01,810
...how much they can do with so little material.
料子卻那麼少

20
00:02:02,050 --> 00:02:06,210
And they play with your mind. Is it there? Is it not there?
它還會戲弄你 有穿嗎？沒穿嗎？

21
00:02:07,220 --> 00:02:09,880
Are you aware that you're still talking?
你知道你還在碎碎念嗎？

22
00:02:10,890 --> 00:02:14,520
Is anyone thankful for anything else besides a thong?
有沒有人要感謝 丁字褲以外的東西？

23
00:02:15,100 --> 00:02:19,260
I don't know. Am I more thankful for my divorce or my eviction?
我不知道要比較感謝離婚 還是被趕出來

24
00:02:19,570 --> 00:02:22,760
And I didn't think you'd be able to come up with anything.
我還以為你會沒得謝

25
00:02:25,170 --> 00:02:28,170
I'm sorry. This is the worst Thanksgiving ever.
抱歉，這是最慘的一次感恩節

26
00:02:28,410 --> 00:02:30,570
I am the king of bad Thanksgivings.
不行，我才是悲慘感恩節盟主

27
00:02:30,850 --> 00:02:34,910
You can't swoop in with your bad marriage and take that away from me.
你不能挾失敗的婚姻空降 搶了我的寶座

28
00:02:35,420 --> 00:02:39,110
You're not going to tell about your parents' divorce again,are you?
你又要說你爸媽離婚的事了？

29
00:02:41,090 --> 00:02:43,060
Come on! I want to hear it.
別這樣嘛，我想聽

30
00:02:44,890 --> 00:02:48,450
It wouldn't be Thanksgiving without Chandler bumming us out.
沒有錢德掃興就不算感恩節了

31
00:02:49,630 --> 00:02:51,530
It's a tradition,like the parade.
這跟遊行一樣是一項傳統

32
00:02:51,770 --> 00:02:56,230
If the parade decided it was gay and abandoned its family.
如果遊行也出櫃離家 拋妻棄子的話

00:02:57,970 --> 00:02:59,030
「1978年感恩節」

33
00:02:59,270 --> 00:03:00,570
Now,Chandler,dear...
錢德

34
00:03:00,810 --> 00:03:02,970
...just because we're getting a divorce...
爸爸和我要離婚 

35
00:03:03,210 --> 00:03:04,940
...doesn't mean we don't love you.
並不代表我們不愛你

36
00:03:05,610 --> 00:03:06,640
It just means...
只是代表...

37
00:03:06,880 --> 00:03:10,370
...he would rather sleep with the houseboy than with me.
...他上床的對像是男僕 不是我

38
00:03:13,290 --> 00:03:15,380
More turkey,Mr. Chandler?
小少爺還要火雞嗎？

39
00:03:19,430 --> 00:03:23,330
Every time you tell that story, that guy's accent gets thicker and thicker.
你把那傢伙的口音 說得越來越重

40
00:03:25,230 --> 00:03:27,290
So are he and your dad still together?
他們還在一起嗎？

41
00:03:27,470 --> 00:03:31,560
No. After they got their own place, the houseboy got his own houseboy.
沒有，他們同居之後 男僕自己也有了男僕

42
00:03:31,810 --> 00:03:34,100
Should have heard his accent.
你應該聽聽他的口音

43
00:03:34,610 --> 00:03:38,600
You're right,yours is worse. You're the king of bad Thanksgivings.
你說得對，你的更慘 你是悲慘感恩節盟主

44
00:03:38,780 --> 00:03:41,010
I've got one that's worse.
不一定，我有一次更慘

45
00:03:41,220 --> 00:03:44,550
Really? Worse than, "More turkey,Mr. Chandler?"
慘過「小少爺還要火雞」嗎？

46
00:03:46,790 --> 00:03:49,190
Did the little rich boy have a problem with the butler?
小少爺跟僕人有仇嗎？ 

47
00:03:49,390 --> 00:03:51,220
Yes,mine's worse!
對，我的更慘

48
00:03:53,099 --> 00:03:55,397
「1862年感恩節」

49
00:03:56,930 --> 00:03:58,230
More bandages!
還要繃帶！

50
00:03:58,470 --> 00:04:00,400
More bandages!
還要繃帶

51
00:04:00,640 --> 00:04:03,300
Please,can I get some more bandages in here?
再給我一些繃帶 

52
00:04:03,570 --> 00:04:05,400
This man is
這個人快死…

53
00:04:09,983 --> 00:04:11,575
Oh，no
不會吧

54
00:04:14,620 --> 00:04:16,710
In this life,Phoebe.
今生的才算

55
00:04:17,790 --> 00:04:19,150
Oh,this life. Oh,okay.
今生是吧

56
00:04:19,390 --> 00:04:20,650
No,Chandler's is worse.
那錢德的比較慘

57
00:04:22,560 --> 00:04:25,050
It must be cool remembering stuff like that.
記得前世的事一定很酷 

58
00:04:25,260 --> 00:04:27,730
I don't have any past-life memories.
我都沒有前世的記憶

59
00:04:28,330 --> 00:04:31,460
Of course,you don't,sweetie. You're brand-new.
當然沒有，你是新生命

60
00:04:33,640 --> 00:04:35,630
I know Monica's worst Thanksgiving.
我知道摩妮卡最慘的感恩節

61
00:04:36,140 --> 00:04:38,400
Let's not tell this story.
那個就別提了 說嘛

62
00:04:38,970 --> 00:04:40,000
I know!
我知道

63
00:04:40,240 --> 00:04:44,080
It's the one where Joey got Monica's turkey stuck on his head.
就是摩妮卡的火雞 卡在喬伊頭上那次

64
00:04:46,350 --> 00:04:49,180
Joey got a turkey stuck on his head?
什麼？喬伊頭上卡了只火雞？

65
00:04:49,450 --> 00:04:50,780
It's not like it sounds.
其實不是那樣 

66
00:04:51,020 --> 00:04:53,080
It's exactly like it sounds.
其實就是那樣

67
00:04:56,496 --> 00:04:58,828
「1992年感恩節」

68
00:05:08,041 --> 00:05:09,338
菲比？

69
00:05:10,340 --> 00:05:12,140
What's going on?
喬伊？怎麼了？

70
00:05:12,111 --> 00:05:13,339
你看

71
00:05:15,340 --> 00:05:16,540
Oh,my God!
我的天哪 

72
00:05:16,810 --> 00:05:18,010
I know!
我知道

73
00:05:18,480 --> 00:05:20,040
It's stuck!
它卡住了

74
00:05:21,620 --> 00:05:22,610
Step.
小心台階 

75
00:05:22,850 --> 00:05:24,370
How did it get on?
它怎麼會跑到你頭上？

76
00:05:24,620 --> 00:05:27,110
I put it on to scare Chandler.
是我套上去想嚇錢德

77
00:05:27,560 --> 00:05:30,990
Oh,my God! Monica's going to totally freak out!
天哪，摩妮卡一定會氣死

78
00:05:31,190 --> 00:05:32,630
Help me get it off!
那就趕快幫我拿下來 

79
00:05:32,860 --> 00:05:35,620
Plus,it smells really bad in here.
而且這裡面好臭

80
00:05:37,000 --> 00:05:41,160
Of course it smells bad. You have your head up a dead animal's ass.
當然很臭 你的頭塞在動物屍體的屁股裡

81
00:05:43,142 --> 00:05:44,336
是摩妮卡

82
00:05:51,350 --> 00:05:53,180
Did you get the turkey?
你替火雞塗…

83
00:05:53,380 --> 00:05:54,970
Oh,my God!
我的天哪

84
00:05:55,220 --> 00:05:56,210
Who is that?
那是誰？ 

85
00:05:56,880 --> 00:05:58,650
It's Joey.
喬伊啦

86
00:05:59,690 --> 00:06:01,990
Is this supposed to be funny?
你在幹什麼？你是在搞笑嗎？

87
00:06:02,190 --> 00:06:05,280
It's not supposed to be funny. It's supposed to be scary.
不是搞笑，是嚇人

88
00:06:06,690 --> 00:06:07,790
Get that off now!
馬上給我拿掉

89
00:06:08,030 --> 00:06:10,000
I can't. It's stuck!
拿不掉，卡住了

90
00:06:10,200 --> 00:06:14,830
It has to feed 20 people. They're not going to eat it off your head!
我不管，我爸媽的二十個客人 可不能就著你的頭吃

91
00:06:15,370 --> 00:06:16,360
Hold on.
先別急

92
00:06:16,570 --> 00:06:18,660
Let's just all think.
大家一起想辦法

93
00:06:24,250 --> 00:06:25,300
I got it!
我知道了

94
00:06:26,480 --> 00:06:27,470
You pull.
菲比， 你拉

95
00:06:27,680 --> 00:06:30,740
I'll spread the legs as wide as I can.
我盡量把腿撐開

96
00:06:33,720 --> 00:06:35,710
Now is not the time. Sorry.
喬伊，現在不要鬧 對不起

97
00:06:36,860 --> 00:06:38,660
Count to three. One...
好，數到三…一...

98
00:06:38,830 --> 00:06:39,850
...two...
...二...

99
00:06:40,030 --> 00:06:41,150
...three!
...三

100
00:06:44,730 --> 00:06:47,670
It worked! I scared you! I knew it!
成功了！我嚇到你了

101
00:06:50,200 --> 00:06:51,260
I'm here,big guy.
大哥，我在這裡

102
00:06:51,540 --> 00:06:53,030
Yeah,you are!
我知道

103
00:06:53,910 --> 00:06:55,380
I scared you!
我嚇到你了

104
00:06:58,950 --> 00:07:01,240
You did look like an idiot.
你看起來真的很白癡

105
00:07:02,420 --> 00:07:05,010
I wasn't the only one who looked like an idiot.
白癡的不只是我

106
00:07:05,750 --> 00:07:08,590
Remember when Ross tried to say "butternut squash"...
羅斯有一次想說冬南瓜 

107
00:07:08,790 --> 00:07:11,950
...and it came out, "squatternut bosh"?
結果講成南冬瓜

108
00:07:14,400 --> 00:07:16,190
Yeah,that's the same.
的確一樣白癡

109
00:07:18,530 --> 00:07:21,200
That's it. That's my worst Thanksgiving.
那就是我最慘的感恩節

110
00:07:21,400 --> 00:07:23,460
That can't be the one Rachel meant.
等等，瑞秋說的不可能是那次 

111
00:07:23,700 --> 00:07:25,760
She didn't even know that happened.
她根本不知道那件事

112
00:07:26,270 --> 00:07:27,540
So,what's yours?
所以是哪一次？ 哪一次？

113
00:07:28,380 --> 00:07:30,810
I really don't want to tell this story.
我真的不想提這件事

114
00:07:31,050 --> 00:07:35,780
Reliving pain and getting depressed is what Thanksgiving's all about.
講嘛，重溫悲慘的回憶 是感恩節的精神

115
00:07:37,390 --> 00:07:38,580
For me,anyway.
至少我覺得是 

116
00:07:38,790 --> 00:07:41,620
And,of course,the lndians.
還有原住民的幫忙

117
00:07:41,890 --> 00:07:44,760
Of all people,you do not want me to tell this story.
最不希望我提的絕對是你

118
00:07:44,960 --> 00:07:46,720
What is that supposed to mean?
什麼意思？

00:07:47,600 --> 00:07:48,230
「1987年感恩節」 

119
00:07:48,400 --> 00:07:51,430
-Monica,I think Rachel's here! -I'll get it!
摩妮卡，應該是瑞秋來了 我來開

121
00:07:58,570 --> 00:07:59,630
Happy Thanksgiving!
感恩節快樂

122
00:07:59,840 --> 00:08:01,400
Not for me.
我不快樂

123
00:08:01,640 --> 00:08:03,940
Chip and I broke up.
奇普和我分手了

124
00:08:04,450 --> 00:08:05,500
Why?
為什麼？

125
00:08:05,780 --> 00:08:07,010
What happened?
怎麼了？

126
00:08:07,250 --> 00:08:10,450
My parents are out of town, and Chip was going to come over.
我爸媽不是要出門 奇普不是要來…

127
00:08:11,020 --> 00:08:13,110
And you were going to give him...
對，你要給他...

128
00:08:13,350 --> 00:08:14,620
...your "flower."
...你的花芯

129
00:08:15,820 --> 00:08:17,690
Monica,can you just call it sex?
摩妮卡，你能不能直接說做愛 

130
00:08:17,990 --> 00:08:21,020
It really creeps me out when you call it that.
你那樣講讓我渾身發毛

131
00:08:21,260 --> 00:08:22,420
And by the way...
還有...

132
00:08:22,660 --> 00:08:26,530
...while we're at it,a guy's thing is not called his "tenderness."
...在做的時候 男人的那裡不叫他的溫柔

133
00:08:29,600 --> 00:08:31,270
Believe me.
相信我

134
00:08:35,110 --> 00:08:36,800
Happy Thanksgiving.
瑞秋 感恩節快樂 你也是

136
00:08:40,152 --> 00:08:41,176
天哪

137
00:08:44,350 --> 00:08:45,340
Everyone...
各位 

138
00:08:45,550 --> 00:08:47,610
...this is Chandler.
這是錢德

139
00:08:47,820 --> 00:08:48,850
My roommate...
我的室友...

140
00:08:49,060 --> 00:08:51,720
...and lead singer of our band.
...兼我們樂團的主唱

141
00:08:54,100 --> 00:08:55,124
羅斯

142
00:08:55,700 --> 00:08:56,990
This is Monica.
這是摩妮卡 

143
00:08:57,700 --> 00:08:59,460
I'm Ross' little sister.
我是羅斯的妹妹

144
00:09:00,273 --> 00:09:01,399
好

145
00:09:03,970 --> 00:09:05,910
I'm so glad you could come.
歡迎你來

146
00:09:06,210 --> 00:09:08,470
We've got plenty of food, so I hope you're hungry.
有很多吃的 希望你餓了

147
00:09:08,680 --> 00:09:13,480
Chandler hates Thanksgiving and doesn't eat any Thanksgiving food.
媽，錢德痛恨感恩節 他不吃感恩節食物

148
00:09:14,050 --> 00:09:16,520
I'm so glad you brought him here.
那還真是歡迎啊

150
00:09:19,320 --> 00:09:22,150
I can make you some macaroni and cheese for dinner.
錢德 我可以幫你煮起司通心面

151
00:09:22,390 --> 00:09:24,260
As long as the Pilgrims didn't eat it.
只要當年的清教徒沒吃我就吃

152
00:09:28,600 --> 00:09:29,860
Damn it!
討厭

154
00:09:41,040 --> 00:09:43,100
Does it feel weird around here now?
瑞秋，你會不會覺得怪怪的？

155
00:09:43,340 --> 00:09:46,540
You know,since I've been away at college?
我去上大學不在了以後

00:09:47,680 --> 00:09:48,840
Not really.
那倒不會

157
00:09:49,950 --> 00:09:51,540
That's cool.
那就好

158
00:09:52,425 --> 00:09:53,858
那你…

159
00:09:56,920 --> 00:10:00,620
So that's Rachel,the girl you've been writing all those songs about?
她就是你那些歌的女主角瑞秋 對

160
00:10:00,800 --> 00:10:05,790
Might want to rethink the lyrics to "She Feels Weird Since I've Been Gone."
你可能得修改那句 「我的離去令她渾身不對勁」

161
00:10:09,340 --> 00:10:14,210
I cannot believe Chip dumped me for that slut Nancy Branson!
奇普居然為了那個花癡南茜 而甩了我

162
00:10:14,410 --> 00:10:18,670
I am never going out with him again. I don't care how much he begs.
我再也不跟他約會了 他再怎麼求我也沒用

163
00:10:18,880 --> 00:10:21,910
His begging days are over,now that he's with Nancy Branson.
他有了南茜，應該不會求你了

164
00:10:24,490 --> 00:10:26,780
I've just had it with high-school boys.
你知道嗎？我受夠高中男生了 

165
00:10:26,990 --> 00:10:28,420
They're just silly.
他們只是些笨蛋

166
00:10:28,660 --> 00:10:31,890
They're just silly,stupid boys.
他們全是些又笨又呆的小毛頭

167
00:10:32,090 --> 00:10:33,490
I'll start dating men.
我要開始跟男人交往

168
00:10:36,000 --> 00:10:36,990
I'm sorry,Judy.
茱蒂，對不起 

169
00:10:37,200 --> 00:10:40,830
I couldn't find that bowl you and Jack were looking for.
我找不到你和傑克要的碗

170
00:10:43,340 --> 00:10:45,700
Call them Mom and Dad,you loser.
叫爸爸媽媽吧，俗辣

171
00:10:48,047 --> 00:10:49,605
摩妮卡

172
00:10:54,220 --> 00:10:55,187
錢德

173
00:10:59,690 --> 00:11:01,280
Did you like the macaroni and cheese?
起司通心面好吃嗎？

174
00:11:01,520 --> 00:11:03,510
It was great. You should be a chef.
很好吃，你應該去當廚師

175
00:11:04,463 --> 00:11:05,794
好啊

176
00:11:09,800 --> 00:11:10,960
Guess what.
你猜怎樣？ 

177
00:11:11,230 --> 00:11:14,400
All this stuff about Nancy being a slut was all a rumor.
南茜很花癡的傳聞都是假的

178
00:11:14,600 --> 00:11:17,940
Chip dumped her,and he wants to come over to my house!
所以奇普甩了她 他今天晚上想來找我

179
00:11:18,140 --> 00:11:20,370
-That is so great! -I know.
太棒了 就是啊

180
00:11:20,610 --> 00:11:24,140
Oh,gosh. Listen, if you and Chip do it tonight...
天哪，要是你和奇普晚上做了 

181
00:11:24,380 --> 00:11:26,440
...promise me you'll tell me everything.
你一定要把細節都告訴我

182
00:11:26,650 --> 00:11:30,480
Totally. It's not that big a deal. We already kind of did it once.
